{"title":"Smithing Hammer","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Tool Smithing Lv 19)</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Tool Smithing at level 19 <span class=\"muted\">(448 XP)</span> from 5× <a href=\"#/item/iron-bar\">Iron Bar</a>, 1× <a href=\"#/item/pine-wood\">Pine Wood</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div class=\"s muted\">No monster drops recorded for this item.</div>\n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/tool-smithing\">Tool smithing</a></p>\n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/smithing-hammer\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/smithing-hammer?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/smithing-hammer?q=crude\">Crude</a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/smithing-hammer?q=shoddy\">Shoddy</a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/smithing-hammer?q=ordinary\">Ordinary</a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/smithing-hammer?q=good\">Good</a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/smithing-hammer?q=excellent\">Excellent</a><a class=\"q-chip on q-superior\" href=\"#/item/smithing-hammer?q=superior\">Superior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/smithing-hammer?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"smithing-hammer\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"artisan\">Artisan</button></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Quality scales this item’s own stats. </p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\" id=\"gearQTable\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Quality</th><th>Stats</th><th>This item</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"gearQRows\"><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/smithing-hammer?q=inferior\" title=\"Show it at Inferior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-inferior\" src=\"data/img/6ffbf1314f120baf6e8d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></td><td>-30%</td><td>-3% success</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/smithing-hammer?q=crude\" title=\"Show it at Crude\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-crude\" src=\"data/img/6ffbf1314f120baf6e8d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></td><td>-20%</td><td>-2% success</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/smithing-hammer?q=shoddy\" title=\"Show it at Shoddy\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-shoddy\" src=\"data/img/6ffbf1314f120baf6e8d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span></td><td>-10%</td><td>-1% success</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/smithing-hammer?q=ordinary\" title=\"Show it at Ordinary\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/6ffbf1314f120baf6e8d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span></td><td>0%</td><td>+0% success</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/smithing-hammer?q=good\" title=\"Show it at Good\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-good\" src=\"data/img/6ffbf1314f120baf6e8d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-good\">Good</span></td><td>+10%</td><td>+1% success</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/smithing-hammer?q=excellent\" title=\"Show it at Excellent\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-excellent\" src=\"data/img/6ffbf1314f120baf6e8d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">Excellent</span></td><td>+22%</td><td>+2.2% success</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/item/smithing-hammer?q=superior\" title=\"Show it at Superior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-superior\" src=\"data/img/6ffbf1314f120baf6e8d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">Superior</span></td><td>+30%</td>